# Letters in the Margin
# Dialogic source. Line signals drive the cinematic layout and save checkpoints.
label line_0
[signal arg="line:0:Rin:protected"]
The forester wrote the symptoms in reverse order.
label line_1
[signal arg="line:1:You:protected"]
The healer said that page was useless.
label line_2
[signal arg="line:2:Rin:protected"]
He read the list. He did not read the dates.
label line_3
[signal arg="line:3:You:protected"]
You think the moss treats the fever, not the cause.
label line_4
[signal arg="line:4:Rin:protected"]
I think we should find out together.
label line_5
[signal arg="line:5:Narrator:protected"]
For the first time, her handwriting joins yours in the treatment book.
